<title>NORWAY: Financial highlights of anticipated Aker RGI group.</title>
<headline>Financial highlights of anticipated Aker RGI group.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aker ASA issued the following notional financial highlights for Aker RGI, the new company which will be formed by the merger of Aker and Norwegian investment group Resource Group International ASA (RGI).</p>
<p>				    (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1995		    Jan-Jun 1996</p>
<p>Operating revenues		 17,054		     9,514</p>
<p>Operating profit		    1,214			 279</p>
<p>Profit after financial items    1,179			 202</p>
<p>Equity ratio (percent)	     32.5			29.7</p>
<p>Total assets			 18.522		    21,233</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
